@startuml
title ExplicitEuler dynamical-system contract

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package dynamics {
  interface DynamicalSystem {
    +state_dimension
    +vector_field(t, state)
  }
}

package simulation {
  class InitialValueProblem {
    +dynamics
    +initial_configuration
    +initial_state
  }

  class ExplicitEuler {
    +progress
    +step_observer
    +integrate(problem, request)
  }

  component "_checked_vector_field(...)" as CheckedField
}

DynamicalSystem --> InitialValueProblem : required capability
InitialValueProblem --> ExplicitEuler : validated physical state
ExplicitEuler --> CheckedField : evaluate each Euler map
DynamicalSystem --> CheckedField : vector_field(t, state)

note right of InitialValueProblem
  The initial-configuration layout
  must match state_dimension.
end note

note right of CheckedField
  Convert to float ndarray.
  Require the candidate shape.
  Reject non-finite values.
end note

note bottom of ExplicitEuler
  No Hamiltonian, extended-momentum,
  Jacobian, or split-flow capability
  is consumed.
end note

@enduml

